<title>SHARJAH: CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT PAKISTAN BY 75 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT PAKISTAN BY 75 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>SHARJAH, United Arab Emirates 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka</p>
<p>beat Pakistan by 75 runs in the Singer Champions' Trophy cricket</p>
<p>tournament on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka: 206 in 49.3 overs; Pakistan 131 in 36</p>
<p>overs.</p>
</text>
